#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:1
msgid "Qwen3-ASR-1.7B"
msgstr "Qwen3-ASR-1.7B"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:3
msgid "1 Introduction"
msgstr "1 简介"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:5
msgid ""
"Qwen3-ASR-1.7B is a 1.7B-parameter automatic speech recognition (ASR) "
"model from the Qwen team. It supports Chinese and English speech, Chinese"
" dialects, multilingual speech, and singing voice transcription, and "
"provides long-audio and streaming inference capabilities."
msgstr ""
"Qwen3-ASR-1.7B 是 Qwen 团队开发的 1.7B 参数自动语音识别 (ASR) 模型。它支持中英文语音、中文方言、多语言语音和歌声转录，并提供长音频和流式推理能力。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:7
msgid ""
"This document describes the supported features, environment preparation, "
"single-node deployment, functional verification, and evaluation workflow "
"for Qwen3-ASR-1.7B on Ascend NPUs."
msgstr ""
"本文档描述了在 Ascend NPU 上部署 Qwen3-ASR-1.7B 所支持的功能、环境准备、单节点部署、功能验证和评估工作流程。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:9
msgid ""
"Qwen3-ASR-1.7B was introduced with upstream vLLM v0.19.0. Use a vLLM-"
"Ascend image that matches your vLLM version, and refer to the support "
"matrix for the current release status."
msgstr ""
"Qwen3-ASR-1.7B 随上游 vLLM v0.19.0 版本引入。请使用与您 vLLM 版本匹配的 vLLM-Ascend 镜像，并参考支持矩阵了解当前发布状态。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:11
msgid "2 Supported Features"
msgstr "2 支持的功能"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:13
msgid ""
"Please refer to the [Supported Features "
"List](../../user_guide/support_matrix/supported_models.md) for the model "
"support matrix."
msgstr ""
"请参考[支持功能列表](../../user_guide/support_matrix/supported_models.md)了解模型支持矩阵。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:15
msgid ""
"Please refer to the [Feature "
"Guide](../../user_guide/feature_guide/index.md) for feature configuration"
" information."
msgstr ""
"请参考[功能指南](../../user_guide/feature_guide/index.md)了解功能配置信息。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:17
msgid "3 Prerequisites"
msgstr "3 前提条件"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:19
msgid "3.1 Model Weight"
msgstr "3.1 模型权重"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:21
msgid ""
"The BF16 model can be deployed with one Ascend 910B 64 GB NPU or one "
"Ascend Atlas inference products 48 GB NPU. Download the model weights "
"from [ModelScope](https://modelscope.cn/models/Qwen/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B)."
msgstr ""
"BF16 模型可以使用一块 Ascend 910B 64 GB NPU 或一块 Ascend Atlas 推理产品 48 GB NPU 进行部署。从 [ModelScope](https://modelscope.cn/models/Qwen/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B) 下载模型权重。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:23
msgid ""
"Download the weights to a directory that is accessible from the "
"deployment environment. For multi-node deployments, use a shared "
"directory; for example, `/root/.cache/`."
msgstr ""
"将权重下载到部署环境可访问的目录。对于多节点部署，请使用共享目录；例如 `/root/.cache/`。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:25
msgid "4 Installation"
msgstr "4 安装"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:27
msgid "4.1 Docker Image Installation"
msgstr "4.1 Docker 镜像安装"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:29
msgid ""
"Use the vLLM-Ascend Docker image that corresponds to your hardware. "
"Replace the model-weight mount with the path used in your environment."
msgstr ""
"使用与您硬件对应的 vLLM-Ascend Docker 镜像。将模型权重挂载路径替换为您环境中使用的路径。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md
msgid "Atlas A2 inference products"
msgstr "Atlas A2 推理产品"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md
msgid "Atlas inference products"
msgstr "Atlas 推理产品"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:85
msgid ""
"Verify that the container is running and that the installed package "
"version matches the image tag:"
msgstr ""
"验证容器正在运行，并且已安装的软件包版本与镜像标签匹配："

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:92
msgid ""
"Expected result: `docker ps` lists the container with status `Up`, and "
"`pip show` displays version information for both packages."
msgstr ""
"预期结果：`docker ps` 列出状态为 `Up` 的容器，并且 `pip show` 显示两个软件包的版本信息。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:94
msgid "4.2 Source Code Installation"
msgstr "4.2 源代码安装"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:96
msgid ""
"f you prefer to build from source instead of using the Docker image, "
"install vLLM-Ascend following the [Installation "
"Guide](../../installation.md)."
msgstr ""
"如果您希望从源代码构建而不是使用 Docker 镜像，请按照[安装指南](../../installation.md)安装 vLLM-Ascend。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:106
msgid "To verify the source installation:"
msgstr "要验证源代码安装："

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:114
msgid "5 Online Service Deployment"
msgstr "5 在线服务部署"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:116
msgid "5.1 Single-Node Online Deployment"
msgstr "5.1 单节点在线部署"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:118
msgid ""
"Single-node deployment runs both audio prefill and decoding on one NPU, "
"making it suitable for development, testing, and small-scale ASR "
"services. Replace `your_model_path` with the local model directory, or "
"use `Qwen/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B` to download the model through the configured "
"model hub."
msgstr ""
"单节点部署在一个 NPU 上同时运行音频预填充和解码，适用于开发、测试和小规模 ASR 服务。将 `your_model_path` 替换为本地模型目录，或使用 `Qwen/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B` 通过配置的模型仓库下载模型。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:154
msgid "Key parameters Descriptions:"
msgstr "关键参数说明："

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:156
msgid ""
"`--tensor-parallel-size 1` uses one NPU. Increase it only after "
"confirming that the hardware and deployment topology support the chosen "
"parallel configuration."
msgstr ""
"`--tensor-parallel-size 1` 使用一个 NPU。仅在确认硬件和部署拓扑支持所选并行配置后，才增加该值。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:157
msgid ""
"`--max-model-len 4096` limits the maximum sequence length. On Atlas 300I "
"DUO, always specify a conservative value explicitly; automatic detection "
"can allocate an oversized attention mask and cause an out-of-memory "
"error."
msgstr ""
"`--max-model-len 4096` 限制最大序列长度。在 Atlas 300I DUO 上，始终显式指定一个保守值；自动检测可能会分配过大的注意力掩码并导致内存不足错误。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:158
msgid ""
"`--gpu-memory-utilization 0.9` sets the fraction of device memory "
"available to the vLLM executor. Lower this value if other workloads share"
" the NPU."
msgstr ""
"`--gpu-memory-utilization 0.9` 设置 vLLM 执行器可用的设备内存比例。如果其他工作负载共享 NPU，请降低此值。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:159
msgid ""
"`--enforce-eager` disables graph execution. It is used in the Atlas 300I "
"A2 2UP example for compatibility."
msgstr ""
"`--enforce-eager` 禁用图执行。在 Atlas 300I A2 2UP 示例中用于兼容性。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:161
msgid ""
"When the service starts successfully, the log contains `Application "
"startup complete`. If startup fails, see the [Public "
"FAQ](https://docs.vllm.ai/projects/ascend/en/latest/faqs.html)."
msgstr ""
"当服务成功启动时，日志包含 `Application startup complete`。如果启动失败，请参阅[公共 FAQ](https://docs.vllm.ai/projects/ascend/en/latest/faqs.html)。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:163
msgid "6 Functional Verification"
msgstr "6 功能验证"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:165
msgid ""
"After the service is started, the model can be invoked by sending a "
"prompt."
msgstr ""
"服务启动后，可以通过发送提示来调用模型。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:167
msgid "**Chat Completions API:**"
msgstr "**聊天补全 API：**"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:192
msgid ""
"Replace `localhost`, `8000`, and `qwen3-asr` with the address, port, and "
"`--served-model-name` used by your deployment. Expected result: HTTP 200 "
"and a JSON response containing the transcription in the `choices` field."
msgstr ""
"将 `localhost`、`8000` 和 `qwen3-asr` 替换为您的部署所使用的地址、端口和 `--served-model-name`。预期结果：HTTP 200 以及一个 JSON 响应，其中 `choices` 字段包含转录文本。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:194
msgid "7 Accuracy Evaluation"
msgstr "7 精度评估"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:196
msgid ""
"Evaluate transcription quality with Word Error Rate (WER) for word-level "
"recognition and Character Error Rate (CER) for character-level "
"recognition."
msgstr ""
"使用词错误率 (WER) 评估词级识别质量，使用字符错误率 (CER) 评估字符级识别质量。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:198
msgid "8 Performance Evaluation"
msgstr "8 性能评估"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:200
msgid ""
"Measure ASR serving performance with audio samples that represent the "
"production workload. Record at least the audio duration, request "
"concurrency, end-to-end latency, real-time factor, and throughput. This "
"ensures that audio preprocessing, request construction, API "
"communication, inference, and response parsing are included in the "
"result."
msgstr ""
"使用代表生产工作负载的音频样本测量 ASR 服务性能。至少记录音频时长、请求并发数、端到端延迟、实时因子和吞吐量。这确保音频预处理、请求构建、API 通信、推理和响应解析都包含在结果中。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:202
msgid ""
"Actual performance varies with hardware, audio duration, concurrency, and"
" deployment configuration. Evaluate short audio, long audio, and "
"concurrent requests separately before selecting a production "
"configuration."
msgstr ""
"实际性能因硬件、音频时长、并发数和部署配置而异。在选择生产配置之前，请分别评估短音频、长音频和并发请求。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:204
msgid "9 Performance Tuning"
msgstr "9 性能调优"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:206
msgid ""
"The following settings are starting points rather than globally optimal "
"configurations. Tune them according to audio duration, concurrency, "
"latency requirements, and available NPU memory."
msgstr ""
"以下设置是起点，而非全局最优配置。请根据音频时长、并发数、延迟要求和可用 NPU 内存进行调整。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:169
msgid "Scenario"
msgstr "场景"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:169
msgid "Recommended Starting Point"
msgstr "推荐起点"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:169
msgid "Key Considerations"
msgstr "关键考虑因素"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:169
msgid "Low latency"
msgstr "低延迟"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:169
msgid "`--tensor-parallel-size 1`, `--max-model-len 4096`"
msgstr "`--tensor-parallel-size 1`，`--max-model-len 4096`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:169
msgid "Use short audio inputs and avoid sharing the NPU with other workloads."
msgstr "使用短音频输入，并避免与其他工作负载共享 NPU。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:169
msgid "High throughput"
msgstr "高吞吐量"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:169
msgid "Increase request concurrency after establishing the latency baseline"
msgstr "在建立延迟基线后增加请求并发数"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:169
msgid ""
"Monitor NPU memory and end-to-end latency; do not use synthetic text-only"
" requests as a proxy for ASR traffic."
msgstr "监控 NPU 内存和端到端延迟；不要使用合成的纯文本请求作为 ASR 流量的代理。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:169
msgid "Long audio"
msgstr "长音频"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:169
msgid "Increase `--max-model-len` only as required"
msgstr "仅根据需要增加 `--max-model-len`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:169
msgid ""
"On Atlas inference products, keep the value conservative because "
"attention-mask memory grows with the configured maximum length."
msgstr "在 Atlas 推理产品上，保持该值保守，因为注意力掩码内存随配置的最大长度增长。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:214
msgid ""
"For general parameter tuning, refer to the [Performance Tuning "
"Guide](../../developer_guide/performance_and_debug/optimization_and_tuning.md)."
msgstr ""
"有关通用参数调优，请参考[性能调优指南](../../developer_guide/performance_and_debug/optimization_and_tuning.md)。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:216
msgid "10 FAQ"
msgstr "10 常见问题"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:218
msgid ""
"For common environment, installation, and general parameter issues, see "
"the [Public "
"FAQ](https://docs.vllm.ai/projects/ascend/en/latest/faqs.html). This "
"section covers model- and hardware-specific guidance."
msgstr ""
"有关常见的环境、安装和通用参数问题，请参阅[公共 FAQ](https://docs.vllm.ai/projects/ascend/en/latest/faqs.html)。本节涵盖模型和硬件特定的指导。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:220
msgid "Atlas inference products runs out of memory during startup"
msgstr "Atlas 推理产品在启动期间内存不足"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:222
msgid ""
"**Symptom:** The server fails with an out-of-memory error while "
"initializing attention."
msgstr ""
"**症状：** 服务器在初始化注意力时因内存不足错误而失败。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:224
msgid ""
"**Cause:** On Atlas inference products, an automatically detected large "
"context length can create a full causal attention mask whose memory "
"consumption grows quadratically with `max_model_len`."
msgstr ""
"**原因：** 在 Atlas 推理产品上，自动检测到的大上下文长度可能会创建一个完整的因果注意力掩码，其内存消耗随 `max_model_len` 呈二次方增长。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:226
msgid ""
"**Solution:** Always set `--max-model-len` explicitly to a conservative "
"value, such as `4096`, and increase it only after verifying available NPU"
" memory."
msgstr ""
"**解决方案：** 始终将 `--max-model-len` 显式设置为一个保守值，例如 `4096`，并在验证可用 NPU 内存后仅增加该值。"

